            </note>
            <note corresp="#d275-f2" n="56" xml:id="d275-f2-content">
                <p>For text of these resolutions, see Pan American Union, Congress and Conference
                    Series No. 39: <hi rendition="#italic">final act of the inter-american
                        conference on systems of economic and financial control</hi> (Washington,
                    1942); for correspondence concerning this Conference, held at Washington June
                    30–July 10, 1942, see <ref target="frus1942v05#pg_58"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Foreign Relations</hi>, 1942, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>,
                        pp. 58</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d275-f3" n="57" xml:id="d275-f3-content">
                <p>Despatch No. 3721 printed in <ref target="frus1942v06#pg_420"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1942, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">vi</hi>, p. 420</ref>; enclosed draft not
                    printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
